.DS_Store
MUJOCO_LOG.TXT

# The personal skills live in ~/.claude/skills/; this repository keeps only their project layer
# (.claude/skills/<skill>/references/). A SKILL.md here would be ignored in favour of the personal
# skill and drift, so it is never tracked.
.claude/skills/**/SKILL.md
